{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2022a.q39.material.recovered", "text": "田老师给初三（2）班上跳箱分腿腾越课。下面记录的是田老师上课时的一些基本情况。学生练习过程中。田老师在学生助跑时采用“嗒、塔、塔”的语言提示学生的助跑节奏，并用“推手、好的”等语言提示学生的推手时机并加以表扬；田老师通过录像和拍照的方法给每个学生指点动作存在的错误，并进行纠正；对于一些不敢跳的同学采用保护与帮助的方法，使学生成功学会了动作。通过田老师一系列的教学方法，学生掌握动作非常快，取得了良好的教学效果。下课前布置课后体育作业。田老师说：“同学们要想跳得好，课下一定要好好提高上板起跳能力。”有位同学马上问道“老师，我们怎么提高上板起跳能力呀？”田老师说“好的，我教大家几种练习方法。”……", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "66228d26873c887ccee52435519c9cb16c64ac2d381e02e5589674a874d1969b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2810, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3109, "next_source_question_number": 39, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 39, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "66228d26873c887ccee52435519c9cb16c64ac2d381e02e5589674a874d1969b"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2022a.q39"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s1.k11", "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s2.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.313.r007", "ntce.outline.313.r011", "ntce.outline.313.r016", "ntce.outline.313.r017", "ntce.outline.313.r018", "ntce.outline.313.r020", "ntce.outline.313.r028"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2022a.q39"], "word_count": 299, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "66228d26873c887ccee52435519c9cb16c64ac2d381e02e5589674a874d1969b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2810, "decoded_c