{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2022a.q40.material.recovered", "text": "某学校田径运动会，初二（1）班的男生张某报名参加100米跑和跳高比赛，可是跳高和100米比赛同时开始，张某不知道应该先参加哪项比赛，找体育教师求助。就在这时，初三（2）班的女生王某也来找该教师解惑：“老师，我的100米成绩是第一名，可是我在跳远比赛中总是跳不远，没能进入决赛，这是为什么呀？”。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "66228d26873c887ccee52435519c9cb16c64ac2d381e02e5589674a874d1969b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3208, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3355, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 40, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "66228d26873c887ccee52435519c9cb16c64ac2d381e02e5589674a874d1969b"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2022a.q40"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s1.k04"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.313.r004"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2022a.q40"], "word_count": 147, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "66228d26873c887ccee52435519c9cb16c64ac2d381e02e5589674a874d1969b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3208, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3355, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 40, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "66228d26873c887ccee52435519c9cb16c64ac2d381e02e5589674a874d1969b"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unknown", "holder"